# A separate, self-contained git repository that predates src/portal — its own history,
# its own build output. Adding it here would create a submodule link with no remote to
# resolve, which breaks every clone. Left untracked rather than deleted; it is not this
# project's to remove.
/portal/

# Nested scaffold and unrelated writing that live in this working copy but are
# not part of EntraGuard. Neither is a build input.
#
# Scoped to the one unrelated article rather than all of docs/blog/, because
# docs/blog/ also holds this project's own write-up and its figures, which are
# tracked and belong in the repo.
/EntraGuard/
/docs/blog/azure-foundry-opencode/

# Playwright MCP scratch
.playwright-mcp/

# Diagram redistributables: a zip of docs/diagrams plus an unpacked copy of the same
# files. Both duplicate what is already tracked, for 12MB, and drift the moment a
# diagram is re-rendered. Rebuild from the source SVGs instead.
/docs/diagrams/entraguard-detailed-flow-pack/
/docs/diagrams/entraguard-detailed-flow-pack.zip
/docs/diagrams/flows/contact-sheet.png
